   Fulghieri, Paolo, Univ N Carolina, Chapel Hill, NC 27515 USA.
   Fulghieri, Paolo, Ctr Econ Policy Res, London, England.
   Fulghieri, Paolo, European Corp Governance Inst, Brussels, Belgium.}},
DOI = {{10.1086/701356}},
ISSN = {{0022-3808}},
EISSN = {{1537-534X}},
