Abstract = {{Purpose Before providing an overview of the conference with the above
   title and this Special Issue, this paper aims to present a view of the
   meaning of systemic risk, factors that affect systemic risk and measures
   of systemic risk. Thereafter, the conference presentations and the
   papers in this issue are summarized.
   Design/methodology/approach Characteristics and measures of systemic
   risk are reviewed. Conference papers and presentations are summarized.
   Findings While some aspects of systemic risk of a financial institution
   can be measured, an important aspect associated with contagion through
   markets is not easily captured by simple measures.
   Originality/value The conference and the papers in this issue contribute
   to the policy debate about sources and characteristics of systemic risk.}},
