   market resulting from shocks in main international stocks and bonds
   markets on basis of the assessment of market intercon-nectedness. Global
   Vector Autoregressive model was built up for securities markets in
   China, Euro area, Japan and the U.S. Using generalised impulse response
   functions scenarios of influence of shocks in market and estimate of
   contagion level in selected time horizon are simulated.}},
