   Supervision}},
Funding-Text = {{The author's views do not necessarily represent those of the
   International Monetary Fund. I thank Viral V Acharya (the editor), two
   anonymous referees, Keiichi Kawai, and Jerome Vandenbussche for helpful
   comments. I also received valuable feedback from Charles W Calomiris,
